  "ID": "59643",
  "post_title": "Halloween al col·legi Miralcamp d'Onda i al de Ribesalbes",
  "post_date": "2015-10-30 21:27:50",
  "post_name": "halloween-al-col%c2%b7legi-miralcamp-donda-i-al-de-ribesalbes",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Educación|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Els col&middot;legis p&uacute;blics Miralcamp d&#39;Onda (36 fotos) i el de Ribesalbes (60 fotos) han celebrat aquest divendres la festa de Halloween, cadascun a la seua manera. Al centre onder mares i un pare s&#39;han disfressat i despr&eacute;s han maquillat els xiquets i les xiquetes de 5 anys. A l&#39;escola de Ribesalbes, que enguany compleix 25 anys, s&#39;ha disfressat tot el professorat i l&#39;alumnat.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/10462971_522988137859861_4332669425662338411_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Al Miralcamp han aprofitat la festa de Halloween, tradicionalment associada amb la por i les disfresses, &quot;per al treball de desmitificaci&oacute; de la por i aix&iacute; ajudar a superar-la, ja que&nbsp;&eacute;s tan com&uacute; en aquestes edats&quot;, assenyalen des del centre. Pares i mares tamb&eacute; han col&middot;laborat durant la setmana a decorar les depend&egrave;ncies d&#39;infantil del col&middot;legi.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/P1210012.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>&quot;Realitzant aquesta acitivitat aconseguim una motivaci&oacute; en l&#39;alumnat i a&ccedil;&ograve; es reflecteix en la millora de la qualitat educativa al centre&quot;, conclouen.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200987.jpg\" alt=\"p1200987\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200988.jpg\" alt=\"p1200988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200989.jpg\" alt=\"p1200989\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200991.jpg\" alt=\"p1200991\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200992.jpg\" alt=\"p1200992\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200993.jpg\" alt=\"p1200993\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200994.jpg\" alt=\"p1200994\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200995.jpg\" alt=\"p1200995\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200996.jpg\" alt=\"p1200996\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200997.jpg\" alt=\"p1200997\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200998.jpg\" alt=\"p1200998\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1200999.jpg\" alt=\"p1200999\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1210001.jpg\" alt=\"p1210001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1210002.jpg\" alt=\"p1210002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenmiralcampiribesalbes/p1210003.jpg\" alt=\"p1210003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d